<title>ESTONIA: KLEMENTI TO JOIN IN PUSH FOR ST PETERSBURG.</title>
<headline>KLEMENTI TO JOIN IN PUSH FOR ST PETERSBURG.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of clothing manufacturer Klementi has decided to take part in an association of Estonian firms that is to set up representation in Russia's second-largest city, St Petersburg.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it will join with other members of the Large Business Association to establish a company called the Estonian Companies Business Centre in St Petersburg.</p>
<p>It made the decision at a review of its first quarter performance.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
